   Output: ord1, ord2, bkt
   Index Cond: (gap_unread_tbl.bkt = ANY ('{1,2}'::integer[]))
   Merge Sort Key: gap_unread_tbl.ord1, gap_unread_tbl.gap, gap_unread_tbl.ord2
   Merge Stream Key: gap_unread_tbl.bkt
   Merge Streams: 2
   Merge Cond: (gap_unread_tbl.bkt = ANY ('{1,2}'::integer[]))
   Storage Filter: (gap_unread_tbl.x = gap_unread_tbl.gap)
   Filter: (gap_unread_tbl.ord1 = gap_unread_tbl.x)
   Rows Removed by Filter: 1
   Storage Table Read Requests: 1
   Storage Table Read Ops: 2
   Storage Table Rows Scanned: 4
(13 rows)

